<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Hypotekbanken raises four pct 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Hypotekbanken raises four pct 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Hypotekbanken has raised the amount of an existing four percent bond due in 2005 by 100 million crowns to a total of 775 million, arranger Gudme Raaschou said on Friday.</p>
<p>Gudme said all the bonds had been sold. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
